        "purpose": "SecurityAlert — Alert record",
        "query": "let lookback = 24h;\nSecurityAlert\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(lookback)\n| where AlertName has \"Multiple Failed Logins Followed by Success\"\n| project TimeGenerated, AlertName, AlertSeverity, ProviderName, CompromisedEntity, SystemAlertId, Description\n| order by TimeGenerated desc",
        "note": "Use when the alert is ingested into SecurityAlert. If no rows return, pivot to the native source table below.",
