            "query": "index=* earliest=-24h (sourcetype=*azure* OR sourcetype=*signin* OR EventCode=4625 OR action=failure)\n| table _time user src_ip src host app status action signature EventCode\n| sort - _time",
            "note": "Field names vary by identity source; correlate failures and subsequent success by user, source and time."
